WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:03.099
Read the video transcript Follow the connected cards from

00:00:03.099 --> 00:00:07.100
objective and facts through options to the decision needed

00:00:08.034 --> 00:00:11.311
Explain the conflict clearly so the person deciding can

00:00:11.376 --> 00:00:17.390
compare workable choices Notice the separate labels received decided

00:00:17.469 --> 00:00:21.770
and completed A read receipt proves neither approval nor

00:00:21.836 --> 00:00:25.928
completion Record the actual decision and follow through on

00:00:26.007 --> 00:00:30.258
the agreed action The three action cards are supersede

00:00:30.626 --> 00:00:35.495
correct and verify receipt Mark the earlier message superseded

00:00:35.574 --> 00:00:40.061
rather than silently erasing it Send the prominent correction

00:00:40.429 --> 00:00:43.442
update the controlled record and check that affected people

00:00:43.495 --> 00:00:45.666
can act on the corrected information
